# Pin text files to LF regardless of core.autocrlf on the checkout machine.
#
# tools/generate-contract-dtos.php always emits LF. On Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true, a plain checkout rewrites those same files to CRLF, so a
# byte-for-byte comparison (GeneratedDtoTest / `composer check:contract`) reports
# spurious drift that isn't a real contract change. Forcing eol=lf here makes the
# working tree match what the generator produces, on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.php text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
